{# apparatus.knap: the second page, the citations. Every source behind a
   verdict with its standing, every quote deep-linked to the passage it came
   from, the claim map, open questions folded away, and footnotes. It renders
   from its own data or from the same data as verdict.knap: the heading falls
   back from the apparatus page name to the title, and the back-link to the
   verdict appears only when it names a different page. Callout kinds and
   titles, table headers and section headings belong to the template; the
   model writes values only. Shape: shapes/apparatus.json. The engine notes
   in verdict.knap apply here too: fragment_link padding, written-out tables,
   the optional-block opener, and inline if/else. #}{% set heading = apparatus_page ?? title %}
{% set back = verdict_page ?? title %}
{% set deck = subtitle ?? "the receipts, all of them" %}
---
{{ heading | yaml_property:"title" }}
{{ "apparatus" | yaml_property:"type" }}
{% if back != heading %}{{ back | wikilink | yaml_property:"verdict" }}
{% endif %}
{% if date %}{{ date | yaml_property:"date" }}
{% endif %}
{{ sources | map:"name" | wikilink | yaml_property:"sources" }}
---
{{ heading | h1 }}

{{ deck | italic }}
{% if back != heading %}{{ "" }}
The receipts behind {{ back | wikilink }}. Sources cited: {{ sources | length }}.
{% endif %}

{{ "Reliability is how far we trust a source. Give-a-shit is how much it moved the verdict. Every quote links to the exact passage it came from." | callout:("info", "How to read this page") }}

{{ "Source ledger" | h2 }}

| Source | Kind | Reliability | Give-a-shit | Accessed |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
{% for s in sources %}
| {{ s.name | wikilink }} | {{ s.rel | code }} | {{ s.reliability | bold }} | {{ s.gaf }} | {{ s.accessed ?? "undated" }} |
{% endfor %}

{{ "Sources" | h2 }}
{% for s in sources %}{{ "" }}
{{ s.name | wikilink | h3 }}

{{ s.url | link:"Read the source" }} · {{ s.rel | code }} · reliability {{ s.reliability | bold }} · give-a-shit {{ s.gaf }}
{% for q in s.quotes %}{{ "" }}
{{ q.text | merge:"" | fragment_link:s.url | first | callout:("quote", "Pulled quote") }}
{% if q.used_for %}{{ "" }}
Backs {{ q.used_for }}.
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% endfor %}
{% if receipts %}{{ "" }}
{{ "Claim map" | h2 }}

| Claim | Backed by | Confidence |
| --- | --- | --- |
{% for r in receipts %}
| {% if r.note %}{{ r.claim }}[^{{ r.note | kebab }}]{% else %}{{ r.claim }}{% endif %} | {% if r.source %}{{ r.source | wikilink }}{% else %}nothing yet{% endif %} | {{ r.confidence ?? "unrated" }} |
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% if caveats %}{{ "" }}
{{ caveats | list | callout:("warning", "Open questions", true) }}
{% endif %}
{% if footnotes %}{{ "" }}
{{ "Footnotes" | h2 }}

{{ footnotes | footnote }}
{% endif %}
